Bridge Preventative Maintenance. The work will consist of deck rehabilitation (LMC), joint replacement, painting the steel beams, anchor bolt repairs, spall/delamination repair of the superstructure and substructure, epoxy injecting cracks, and correction of erosion issues.
1.	I-75 NB over Etowah River, Structure ID 015-0085-0, Bartow County; 
2.	I-75 SB over Etowah River, Structure ID 015-0086-0, Bartow County; 
3.	I-75 SB Ramp to US 411, Structure ID 015-0105-0, Bartow County.
